      "heading": "",
      "text": "The enquiry can then be revised transparently. A new question or wider sample is a next investigation, not a retrospective change to the original prediction. Retain the first results and explain why the revision follows from their limits. This preserves useful evidence while allowing better questions, methods and decisions to develop through repeated work.",
